OL,3,GNEWSAHit-and-run driver jailed for
OL,4,Athree years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn uninsured driver who failed to stop
OL,7,Fafter hitting a pedestrian in Grimsby
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for three years.
OL,10,FJames Pickard, 37, of Ross Way,
OL,11,FScartho, was driving a blue Range Rover
OL,12,Fdown Freeman Street in August when he
OL,13,Fstruck a 46-year-old man crossing the
OL,14,Froad, leaving the victim with serious
OL,15,Flife-changing injuries, police said.
OL,17,FPickard previously admitted causing
OL,18,Fserious injury by driving while
OL,19,Fdisqualified, failing to stop after a
OL,20,Froad traffic collision and driving
OL,21,Funinsured.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
